{"seq":4,"slug":"practice","title":"工程实践","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/consistent-hashing/practice","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"replication-placement","title":"复制与放置","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/consistent-hashing/practice/replication-placement","wordCount":1489,"readingTime":6},{"seq":2,"slug":"rebalancing","title":"再平衡","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/consistent-hashing/practice/rebalancing","wordCount":1550,"readingTime":7},{"seq":3,"slug":"systems-pitfalls","title":"系统与陷阱","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/consistent-hashing/practice/systems-pitfalls","wordCount":1587,"readingTime":7}],"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"工程实践\">工程实践</h1><p>算法在白板上优雅，落到生产环境却要面对副本、故障、扩容、抖动这些粗粝的现实。这一章的三篇是把前面所有理论装进真实系统时必须跨过的三道关卡。</p>\n<p>第一道关是复制与放置。一份数据只存一台机器是不可接受的，必须有 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 个副本。但副本不能随意放——顺时针取环上接下来的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 个节点听起来简单，真要保证这 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 个落在不同物理机、不同机架、不同可用区，就得在「沿环行走」时跳过不满足条件的候选，构造出 Dynamo 所谓的 preference list。这一篇讲清楚副本怎么选、怎么跳。</p>\n<p>第二道关是再平衡。节点加入要从邻居那里接管一段数据并完成流式拷贝；节点永久退出要把它的数据补到新的负责人；节点临时抖动则用 hinted handoff 先把写暂存在别处、待其恢复再回传。这一篇讲数据在这些事件中如何流动，以及怎样把流量和迁移量控制在可接受范围。</p>\n<p>第三道关是系统与陷阱。Cassandra、DynamoDB、Maglev、HAProxy 各自怎样使用一致性哈希？它们的选型差异背后是什么取舍？同时把工程上反复出现的坑——虚拟节点数量配错、热点键、扩容抖动、哈希函数选择不当——集中列出，让你提前避开。</p>\n<p>这一章不引入新算法，而是反复调用前三章的概念，把它们组装成能上线的系统。建议在已经熟悉环、虚拟节点、有界负载之后再读，因为这里默认你已经掌握了它们的记号与性质。</p>\n"}